# Build context for both apps/web/Dockerfile and workers/runtime/Dockerfile
# is the repo root (pnpm workspace; workers/runtime/catalog/base.py resolves
# packages/schemas relative to the repo root — see that Dockerfile). Each
# COPY is scoped to what that particular image needs; this file just strips
# things neither image ever needs.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/out
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts

# Python — .venv/caches get rebuilt inside the image; tests aren't shipped
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.venv
**/*.egg-info
**/.pytest_cache
workers/runtime/tests

.git
.github
.claude

# Secrets never enter a build context
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

docs/
specs/
scripts/
*.md
.DS_Store
*.log
